<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '48px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>再验证：谁在憔悴</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>环节四 · 再验证</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, padding: '32px 40px', background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.05)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2, letterSpacing: 1 }}>满地黄花堆积，憔悴损，如今有谁堪摘？</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 32, borderLeft: '4px solid #B4552D', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>“憔悴损”的“损”，主语是花，还是人？</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 12 }}>用刚才那个方法答：先说依据，再说结论。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《声声慢》· 李清照</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>12/16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>